    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mini-game with unlimited gold coins, and you only need to control the cute piggy bank to start a never-ending carnival of wealth. Keyboard: W/S/A/D control piggy bank, unlimited gold coins can be picked up No time mechanism, every collection can set off a crisp symphony of gold coin collision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game cannot be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard moves W/S/A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause the ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle fullscreen/window F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Alt F4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush to gold~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Good luck~</p>",
